Package: com.qwq.blelogger
Name: BLE Logger
Version: 1.2.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: 抓取第三方 App 的 BLE 读写，悬浮球内查看、单条复制
 设置 -> BLE Logger：总开关 + 勾选要注入的 App（不勾 = 全部第三方 App）。
 注入后 hook CoreBluetooth 的写入与通知回调，在 App 内显示可拖动的
 BLE 圆点，点开可见全部收发帧，点任一条复制成
 ble:设备|服务|特征|HEX 格式。
 日志落盘 /var/mobile/Library/Preferences/ble-capture.log。
Maintainer: 777qwq
Author: 777qwq
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
